    <div class="chart-container">{charts['phase_runs']}</div>
    <div class="insight-box">
      <strong>Key Insight:</strong> The phase distribution reveals where teams invest their wicket and scoring capital. The powerplay and death overs typically contribute disproportionately to the total, reflecting the fielding-restriction advantage early and the all-out attack at the death.
